      "description": "Tuff Bowl\nBuilt tough for everyday use, the Tuff Bowl is anything but ordinary.\n\nCrafted from double-walled stainless steel, it's exceptionally durable, corrosion-resistant, and built to withstand daily meals and adventures. The removable silicone base helps keep the bowl securely in place, reducing slips and spills while your dog eats or drinks.\n\nCleaning up is just as easy—simply place it on the top rack of your dishwasher, and it's ready for the next meal.\n\nKey Features\n• Durable double-walled stainless steel construction.\n• Corrosion- and rust-resistant for long-lasting use.\n• Non-slip silicone base helps minimise movement during mealtimes.\n• Easy to clean and dishwasher safe (top rack recommended).\n\nMaterials\n• Structure: 100% Stainless Steel\n• Base: 100% Silicone\n\nSize\nMedium\n• Diameter: 7.3 in (18.5 cm)\n• Capacity: 1,200 ml",
